# Local Terraform working-directory artifacts — never commit these.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# The bootstrap config is the one exception that deliberately keeps local
# state (see bootstrap/versions.tf). Still don't commit the state file
# itself — if it's lost, re-import the bucket or recreate it; the bucket
# has prevent_destroy set so the data survives either way.
